    "story": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "caption": {
          "type": "caption",
          "settings": {
            "caption": "OUR STORY",
            "text_style": "caption-with-letter-spacing",
            "text_size": "medium"
          }
        },
        "heading": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "GLORAC was born from a love of quiet beauty. The kind that does not need to announce itself.",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We believe the pieces closest to the body should feel as beautiful as they look. From fluid silk sleepwear to softly feminine dresses and scarves, every GLORAC piece is created around ease, elegance and the simple pleasure of feeling beautifully dressed.</p><p>Our collections are inspired by the quieter moments of life — slow mornings, evenings at home, journeys away, and occasions remembered long after they have passed.</p><p><em>Luxury, to us, is not excess. It is how something feels.</em></p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "caption",
        "heading",
        "text"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "desktop_content_position": "center",
        "content_alignment": "left",
        "color_scheme": "scheme-1",
        "full_width": true,
        "padding_top": 72,
        "padding_bottom": 72
      }
    },
    "philosophy": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
